  <p id="c-chenshu-026-lushan-xuling:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-026-lushan-xuling:p001:m0000" ref="b5c_v7o_svc_AA">徐陵</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-026-lushan-xuling:p001:m0003" ref="b5c_v7o_svc_AA">孝穆</persName>，東海郯人也。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-026-lushan-xuling:p001:m0013" ref="b5c_v7o_svc">超之</persName>，齊鬱林太守，梁員外散騎常侍。父<persName id="c-chenshu-026-lushan-xuling:p001:m0031" ref="b5c_v7o_svc_A">摛</persName>，梁戎昭將軍、太子左衛率，贈侍中、太子詹事，諡貞子。</p>
